服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwjdg_zh6dGWAxX0hq8BHRciAqYQ3IcHCKgBKAo",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjdg_zh6dGWAxX0hq8BHRciAqYQ3IcHCKkBKAs",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_NOISE_LEVEL"],"你覺得吵雜程度如何？",[[[["E:DINING_NOISE_LEVEL_QUIET"],"安靜，適合交談",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjdg_zh6dGWAxX0hq8BHRciAqYQ3YcHCKsBKAA"]],1],null,null,"吵雜程度",null,"0ahUKEwjdg_zh6dGWAxX0hq8BHRciAqYQ3IcHCKoBKAw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_10_TO_30_MIN"],"10 到 30 分鐘",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjdg_zh6dGWAxX0hq8BHRciAqYQ3YcHCK0BKAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwjdg_zh6dGWAxX0hq8BHRciAqYQ3IcHCKwBKA0",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_SPACE_AVAILABILITY"],"這裡的停車情況如何？",[[[["E:PARKING_SPACE_DIFFICULT_TO_FIND"],"停車不方便",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjdg_zh6dGWAxX0hq8BHRciAqYQ3YcHCK8BKAA"]],1],null,null,"停車位",null,"0ahUKEwjdg_zh6dGWAxX0hq8BHRciAqYQ3IcHCK4BKA4",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjdg_zh6dGWAxX0hq8BHRciAqYQ3YcHCLEBKAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjdg_zh6dGWAxX0hq8BHRciAqYQ3IcHCLABKA8",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["道楽売店\n位在西門町巷內的一家拉麵店，有多種拉麵口味可以選擇，需先在外面的小椅凳上候位服務人員會先提供菜單，待服務人員通知後就可以使用點餐機點餐，\n\n內部裝潢比較復古，蠻有日本拉麵店的感覺😆\n坐位不少，但偏小了一些（很適合一個人用餐👍），筷子及調味料需要自取，還有冰水可以飲用。\n\n這次我是吃海老鶏白湯拉麵，麵體是粗麵，不能調整軟硬度但很有嚼勁😋，備料份量十足，有海老餛飩、溏心蛋、舒肥叉燒，湯頭不會太濃剛剛好，有櫻花蝦點綴，鮮味十足，下次會想試試海老沾麵。\n\n我同行友人是點了味玉雞白湯拉麵以及味玉激辛豚骨拉麵，他們的麵體都是細麵，雞白湯味道清淡，適合口味清淡的朋友，味玉激辛豚骨是可以調整辣度，友人選擇微辣覺得剛剛好，喜歡吃辣的朋友或許可以挑戰更辣一些\n\n我們也有點炸物，只是我忘了拍，點了炸牛肉餅跟兩顆炸牡蠣，味道都是剛剛好😊\n整體來說拉麵味道很好，服務也不錯，推👍\n\nHidden Gem in Ximen – Authentic Ramen with Rich Flavor and Great Atmosphere\n\u200bLocated in an alleyway in Ximen, Douraku Baiten is a ramen spot that truly captures the Japanese vibe with its retro interior. It’s a great place for solo diners, though the seating is a bit compact.\n\u200b【Ordering Process】\nYou’ll need to wait on the small stools outside first. The staff will provide a menu while you wait, and once called, you can use the vending machine inside to place your order. It's self-service for cutlery, condiments, and ice water.\n\u200b【The Food】\n\u200bEbi Tori Paitan (Shrimp Chicken Broth): I had this with thick noodles. While the noodle hardness isn't adjustable, they have a fantastic chewy texture. It’s loaded with toppings: shrimp wontons, soft-boiled egg, and sous-vide chashu. The broth is perfectly balanced and topped with dried sakura shrimp for an extra burst of seafood flavor. I’ll definitely try the dipping noodles (Tsukemen) next time!\n\u200bFriends' Choices: My friends tried the Tori Paitan and Spicy Tonkotsu. Both came with thin noodles. The chicken broth is light and clean—perfect for those who prefer milder flavors. For the Spicy Tonkotsu, the heat level is adjustable; the \"mild spicy\" was just right, but spice lovers could definitely go higher.\n\u200bSides: We also ordered the fried beef patty and fried oysters. Both were freshly cooked and tasted great!\n\u200bOverall, the ramen is excellent, and the service is friendly. Highly recommended! 👍",null,[0,73]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/8860182100938851560/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVUdOV1NURlplbEp4Vm14YWIxWXlkRmhOUkVKcVdWVmtabE51WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8860182100938851560/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVUdOV1NURlplbEp4Vm14YWIxWXlkRmhOUkVKcVdWVmtabE51WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/8860182100938851560/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVUdOV1NURlplbEp4Vm14YWIxWXlkRmhOUkVKcVdWVmtabE51WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8860182100938851560/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVUdOV1NURlplbEp